Task: In Formula 1 seasons since 2001, considering only drivers who scored points in a season, which five constructors have had the most seasons where their drivers scored the fewest total points among all point-scoring drivers in that season?

Please answer only one complete SQL in sqlite dialect in ```sql``` format.
